#, no-wrap
msgid "Step 3: Execute using Qiskit primitives {#step-3-execute-using-qiskit-primitives}"
msgstr "Langkah 3: Eksekusi menggunakan primitif Qiskit {#step-3-execute-using-qiskit-primitives}"

